{"seq":3,"slug":"interactive-water","title":"交互水面与涟漪","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-fluid-simulation/realtime-water/interactive-water","wordCount":1401,"readingTime":6,"html":"<h1 id=\"交互水面与涟漪\">交互水面与涟漪</h1><p>Gerstner 波和 FFT 海面再漂亮，都有个共同缺陷：它们是预先定义好的周期波，玩家走过去、扔块石头、开船穿过，水面纹丝不动地照着原剧本起伏。可玩家最在意的恰恰是「水回应了我」——脚边踩出扩散的圈、子弹打出溅起的坑、船尾拖出渐渐消散的尾迹。这一篇讲的就是唯一能让水真正回应玩家的便宜技术：在一张二维高度场上跑波动方程，让外部冲量激起会扩散、会反射、会衰减的真实涟漪。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念-高度场上的波动方程\">核心概念：高度场上的波动方程</h2><p>交互水的载体是一张覆盖水面的二维高度场纹理——每个纹素存一个水面高度 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>h</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>z</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">h(x,z)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">h</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.044em;\">z</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>。让涟漪自然扩散，靠的是离散化的二维波动方程：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mfrac><mrow><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∂</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mi>h</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∂</mi><msup><mi>t</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><msup><mi>c</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∇</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mi>h</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\frac{\\partial^2 h}{\\partial t^2} = c^2\\nabla^2 h</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.1771em;vertical-align:-0.686em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.4911em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\" style=\"margin-right:0.0556em;\">∂</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7401em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.989em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\" style=\"margin-right:0.0556em;\">∂</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">h</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.686em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8641em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8641em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">∇</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8641em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">h</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>左边是高度的加速度，右边 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∇</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mi>h</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\nabla^2 h</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">∇</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">h</span></span></span></span></span>（拉普拉斯）衡量某点比周围邻居高还是低，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>c</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">c</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span></span></span></span></span> 是波速。直觉是：比周围高的点会被往下拉、比周围低的点会被往上推，扰动就这样一圈圈向外传——和把石头丢进池塘看到的完全一致。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;  A[二维高度场纹理 h] --&gt; B[采样上下左右邻居算拉普拉斯]&#10;  B --&gt; C[更新高度速度 显式积分]&#10;  C --&gt; D[乘衰减系数 让涟漪渐弱]&#10;  D --&gt; E[外部冲量写入 玩家 子弹 船]&#10;  E --&gt; F[由高度差求法线 喂给水面着色]&#10;  F -.下一帧 ping-pong 纹理.-&gt; A\">graph TD\n  A[二维高度场纹理 h] --&gt; B[采样上下左右邻居算拉普拉斯]\n  B --&gt; C[更新高度速度 显式积分]\n  C --&gt; D[乘衰减系数 让涟漪渐弱]\n  D --&gt; E[外部冲量写入 玩家 子弹 船]\n  E --&gt; F[由高度差求法线 喂给水面着色]\n  F -.下一帧 ping-pong 纹理.-&gt; A</pre><p>整个更新就是一个邻域卷积，天然适合在 GPU 片元/计算着色器上跑，用两张纹理 ping-pong（一张读一张写）实现，每帧几乎免费。</p>\n<h2 id=\"显式更新与稳定性\">显式更新与稳定性</h2><p>把波动方程离散到网格上，常用「跳蛙」式显式积分，需要存当前高度和上一帧高度（或高度+速度）。一个紧凑的更新式（含衰减）：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>h</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mo fence=\"false\" stretchy=\"true\" minsize=\"1.8em\" maxsize=\"1.8em\">(</mo><msub><mi>h</mi><mtext>up</mtext></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>h</mi><mtext>down</mtext></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>h</mi><mtext>left</mtext></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>h</mi><mtext>right</mtext></msub><mo fence=\"false\" stretchy=\"true\" minsize=\"1.8em\" maxsize=\"1.8em\">)</mo><mo>⋅</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>h</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">h_{t+1} = \\Big(h_{\\text{up}} + h_{\\text{down}} + h_{\\text{left}} + h_{\\text{right}}\\Big)\\cdot\\frac{1}{2} - h_{t-1}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9028em;vertical-align:-0.2083em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">h</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mbin mtight\">+</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2083em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.8em;vertical-align:-0.65em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"delimsizing size2\">(</span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">h</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">up</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8444em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">h</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">down</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8444em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">h</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">left</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.8em;vertical-align:-0.65em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">h</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">right</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"delimsizing size2\">)</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.0074em;vertical-align:-0.686em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3214em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">2</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.686em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9028em;vertical-align:-0.2083em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">h</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mbin mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2083em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>再整体乘一个略小于 1 的衰减系数 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>d</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">d</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span></span></span></span></span>（如 0.99）让涟漪逐渐平息，否则能量永不耗散、水面越来越乱。</p>\n<p>稳定性受 CFL 条件约束：波在一个时间步内传播的距离不能超过一个格子，即 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>c</mi><mtext> </mtext><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><mi>t</mi><mo>≤</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">c\\,\\Delta t \\le \\Delta x</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8193em;vertical-align:-0.136em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≤</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span></span></span></span></span>。超了水面会数值爆炸（高度发散成噪声）。实践中通过限制波速、固定时间步、或对结果做夹紧来保稳定。这与<a href=\"../methods/grid-solvers\">网格求解与投影</a>里欧拉求解器的稳定性考量同源，只是这里是显式格式，不像半拉格朗日那样无条件稳定，必须守住 CFL。</p>\n<h2 id=\"注入交互-把玩家变成外力\">注入交互：把玩家变成外力</h2><p>涟漪从哪来？把外部交互写成高度场的「外力」——这正是<a href=\"../foundations/navier-stokes-intuition\">NS 方程直觉</a>里外力项在高度场版本的化身。常见注入方式：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>点冲量</strong>：子弹、雨滴落点，在对应纹素上瞬时压低（或抬高）高度，激起一个向外扩散的圆。</li>\n<li><strong>移动物体</strong>：角色脚、船体，沿其运动路径在高度场上持续写入位移，自然拖出尾迹。</li>\n<li><strong>力场刷</strong>：技能、爆炸，用一个高斯笔刷在一片区域注入冲量，激起大范围浪。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>把物体当前位置投影到高度场的纹理坐标，在那里累加冲量即可。交互层通常叠在 FFT 或 Gerstner 的「基础海面」之上——基础海面提供大尺度起伏，交互高度场叠加局部回应，两者相加是最终水面。这种分层正是<a href=\"ocean-fft\">海洋 FFT 频谱</a>末尾说的「FFT 不可交互需叠高度场」的具体落地。</p>\n<h2 id=\"与体积流体的边界\">与体积流体的边界</h2><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>方案</th>\n<th>维度</th>\n<th>体积守恒</th>\n<th>能倒出来</th>\n<th>成本</th>\n<th>适用</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>高度场波动</td>\n<td>2.5D</td>\n<td>否（只表面）</td>\n<td>否</td>\n<td>极低</td>\n<td>浅水池、湖面交互</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>浅水方程 SWE</td>\n<td>2.5D</td>\n<td>近似</td>\n<td>弱</td>\n<td>低</td>\n<td>洪水漫流、地形上的水</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>SPH/FLIP</td>\n<td>3D</td>\n<td>是</td>\n<td>是</td>\n<td>高</td>\n<td>灌注、决堤</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>高度场波动方程只能表达「单一表面的上下起伏」，没有体积概念——它无法表达翻卷的碎浪、无法让水倒进杯子、无法处理水柱分裂。一个折中是浅水方程（Shallow Water Equations），它在高度场基础上加了水量守恒，能让水在地形上流动漫延（适合洪水、河流漫滩），但仍是 2.5D，碎浪和容器灌注还是得回<a href=\"../methods/sph-particles\">SPH 粒子流体</a>或<a href=\"../methods/flip-pic-hybrid\">FLIP/PIC 混合法</a>。判断标准很简单：玩家只在水「上面」交互就用高度场，玩家要让水「装起来、倒出去」才上体积。</p>\n<h2 id=\"渲染与性能要点\">渲染与性能要点</h2><p>高度场算完，对相邻纹素求高度差得到法线，喂给水面着色做反射折射——和<a href=\"wave-models\">波动与 Gerstner 波</a>的解析法线思路一致，只是这里靠差分。性能上，高度场分辨率（如 256×256）和更新频率决定成本，远处的水可以降分辨率甚至关掉交互层只留基础海面，这种按距离分级是<a href=\"../practice/fluid-performance\">流体性能与 LOD</a>的标准操作。交互水的视觉收尾——折射扭曲、岸边泡沫、深度颜色——与<a href=\"../practice/fluid-rendering\">流体渲染与表面重建</a>共享同一套水面着色。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>交互水是唯一能让水回应玩家的便宜技术：在二维高度场上跑波动方程激起扩散涟漪。</li>\n<li>波动方程靠拉普拉斯让扰动向外传，更新是邻域卷积，用 ping-pong 纹理在 GPU 上几乎免费。</li>\n<li>显式格式必须守 CFL 条件 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>c</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><mi>t</mi><mo>≤</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">c\\Delta t\\le\\Delta x</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8193em;vertical-align:-0.136em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≤</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span></span></span></span></span>，配衰减系数让涟漪渐弱、防爆炸。</li>\n<li>玩家、子弹、船作为「外力」注入高度场冲量，交互层叠在 FFT/Gerstner 基础海面之上。</li>\n<li>高度场只表达单一表面、无体积；要碎浪与灌注需上 SPH/FLIP，要漫流可用浅水方程。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"延伸阅读-跨库链接\">延伸阅读 / 跨库链接</h2><ul>\n<li>同 hub：<a href=\"wave-models\">波动与 Gerstner 波</a>、<a href=\"ocean-fft\">海洋 FFT 频谱</a>、<a href=\"../foundations/navier-stokes-intuition\">NS 方程直觉</a>、<a href=\"../practice/fluid-rendering\">流体渲染与表面重建</a></li>\n<li>跨 hub：<a href=\"../../game-graphics/post-processing/screen-space-effects\">屏幕空间效果</a>、<a href=\"../../game-physics/rigid-body-dynamics/newtonian-mechanics\">牛顿力学基础</a></li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"交互水面与涟漪","id":"交互水面与涟漪"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：高度场上的波动方程","id":"核心概念-高度场上的波动方程"},{"level":2,"text":"显式更新与稳定性","id":"显式更新与稳定性"},{"level":2,"text":"注入交互：把玩家变成外力","id":"注入交互-把玩家变成外力"},{"level":2,"text":"与体积流体的边界","id":"与体积流体的边界"},{"level":2,"text":"渲染与性能要点","id":"渲染与性能要点"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"},{"level":2,"text":"延伸阅读 / 跨库链接","id":"延伸阅读-跨库链接"}],"prev":{"title":"海洋 FFT 频谱","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-fluid-simulation/realtime-water/ocean-fft"},"next":{"title":"流体渲染与表面重建","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-fluid-simulation/practice/fluid-rendering"}}